Attribution for upstream sources
--------------------------------

The dataset in this repository consolidates entries that originate from a wide
range of public sources, each retaining its own attribution via the
`references` field on every incident. Where an entry derives from one of the
following sources, please retain its original attribution in any downstream
use:

  - OWASP GenAI Security Project (OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications, Agentic
    AI Threats & Mitigations) — https://genai.owasp.org/
  - MITRE ATLAS — https://atlas.mitre.org/
  - AI Incident Database — https://incidentdatabase.ai/
  - AI Vulnerability Database (AVID) — https://avidml.org/
  - NIST AI Risk Management Framework — https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework
  - Individual researchers, vendors, and outlets cited inline in each entry's
    `references` array.

This dataset is not endorsed by any of the above organizations.
